## Expected Benefits

- Reduced time spent investigating machine failures
- Improved visibility into failure sequences
- Faster troubleshooting and maintenance decisions
- Better understanding of relationships between machine signals
- A foundation for predictive maintenance systems

## Project Status

Prototype / Development

## Future Enhancements

- Live sensor integration using industrial IoT devices
- Real-time monitoring and alerts
- Historical failure analysis
- Machine-specific diagnostic models
- Integration with maintenance management systems
- Validation against labelled machine failure datasets

## Disclaimer

Root cause predictions depend on the quality of the input data, diagnostic logic, and validation. Confidence scores should not be interpreted as verified probabilities unless they have been calibrated and tested against representative failure data.

